          <div>
            <h1>A local-first corpus tool, built in Rust.</h1>
            <p class="lede">CorpusWright is a local-first desktop workbench for preparing, inspecting, and exploring text corpora, with frequency lists, KWIC concordances, collocates, document-spread diagnostics, and reproducible records of every processing step.</p>
            <div class="hero-downloads">
