            <div class="principle">
              <h3>Reproducible</h3>
              <p>Every export ships a manifest: cleaning configuration, tokeniser settings, and SHA-256 checksums of
                every source and processed file.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="principle">
              <h3>Statistical profile</h3>
              <p>A full statistical profile of your corpus: frequency, diversity, dispersion, concentration and
                distributional shape, with every measure defined and clearly explained.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="principle">
              <h3>Transparent</h3>
              <p>Every statistic comes with its formula, an interpretation and its limitations.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="principle">
              <h3>Built in Rust</h3>
              <p>A native Rust core keeps analysis local and deterministic, with reproducible outputs and explicit manifests.</p>
            </div>
